+
+# useEstimateFeesPerGas
+
+Hook for fetching an estimate for the fees per gas (in wei) for a transaction to be likely included in the next block.
+
+## Import
+
+```ts
+import { useEstimateFeesPerGas } from 'wagmi'
+```
+
+## Usage
+
+::: code-group
+```tsx [index.tsx]
+import { useEstimateFeesPerGas } from 'wagmi'
+
