+# `token.useRenounceRoles`
+
+Renounces roles from the caller for a TIP-20 token. [Learn more about token roles](https://docs.tempo.xyz/protocol/tip403/spec)
+
+## Usage
+
+::: code-group
+```ts twoslash [example.ts]
