+## Usage
+
+::: code-group
+```ts twoslash [example.ts]
+// @twoslash-cache: {"v":1,"hash":"0b032ce2f26b3ba60b7d704cf92957c90fd7feb051b6dc255273d25ecb860c75","data":""}
