+# `amm.mint`
+
+Mints liquidity tokens by providing a token pair. [Learn more about the Fee AMM](https://docs.tempo.xyz/protocol/fees/spec-fee-amm)
+
+## Usage
+
+::: code-group
+
+```ts twoslash [example.ts]
