+# `token.setSupplyCap`
+
+Sets the supply cap for a TIP-20 token. Requires the default admin role.
+
+## Usage
+
+::: code-group
+
+```ts twoslash [example.ts]
+// @twoslash-cache: {"v":1,"hash":"3425b57e63dd869d50e97fa72c6063375687c2cec9e58782eaf2d9e3f31e96b3","data":""}
